 "p": [
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Software creation is changing. We are a group of researchers, engineers, and technologists",
   "font": "EB Garamond",
   "size": "17.28px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "23.328px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(237, 236, 236, 0.55)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 398,
   "y": 553
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "We have much to learn, try, and build.",
   "font": "EB Garamond",
   "size": "17.28px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "23.328px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(237, 236, 236, 0.55)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 398,
   "y": 639
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A grid view of all open windows as scaled previews, allowing quick selection to bring any ",
   "font": "system-ui",
   "size": "13px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "20.15px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 452,
   "y": 1592
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Menu item in MenuBar.tsx (View > Mission Control), hotkey F3, or double-tap desktop.",
   "font": "system-ui",
   "size": "13px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "20.15px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 452,
   "y": 1670
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Overlay existing windows into a grid of live previews with spring-based layout animations ",
   "font": "system-ui",
   "size": "13px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "20.15px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 452,
   "y": 1748
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“It was night and day from one batch to another, adoption went from single digits to over ",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4700
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“My favorite enterprise AI service is Cursor. Every one of our engineers, some 40,000, are",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4700
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“The best LLM applications have an autonomy slider: you control how much independence to g",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4700
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“Cursor quickly grew from hundreds to thousands of extremely enthusiastic Stripe employees",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4926
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“The most useful AI tool that I currently pay for, hands down, is Cursor. It's fast, autoc",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4926
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "“It's definitely becoming more fun to be a programmer. We are at the 1% of what's possible",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 392,
   "y": 4926
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Recents",
   "font": "system-ui",
   "size": "11px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "16.5px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.48)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 250,
   "y": 5632
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Voice Chat with Agents",
   "font": "CursorGothic",
   "size": "16px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "24px",
   "ls": "0.08px",
   "color": "rgb(237, 236, 236)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 283,
   "y": 6115
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
